 "title": {
  "en": "Handling exceptions: try, except and else",
  "kn": "ವಿನಾಯಿತಿ ನಿರ್ವಹಣೆ: try, except ಮತ್ತು else"
 },
 "minutes": 40,
 "blocks": [
  {
   "id": "intro",
   "type": "intro",
   "heading": {
    "en": "Catch it before it crashes",
    "kn": "ಕುಸಿಯುವ ಮೊದಲೇ ಹಿಡಿಯಿರಿ"
   },
   "hook": {
    "en": "An ATM does not shut down when you type a wrong amount; it shows a message and asks again. That is exception handling.",
    "kn": "ತಪ್ಪು ಮೊತ್ತ ನಮೂದಿಸಿದಾಗ ATM ಸ್ಥಗಿತವಾಗುವುದಿಲ್ಲ; ಸಂದೇಶ ತೋರಿಸಿ ಮತ್ತೆ ಕೇಳುತ್ತದೆ. ಇದೇ ವಿನಾಯಿತಿ ನಿರ್ವಹಣೆ."
   },
   "objectives": [
    {
     "en": "Explain throwing and catching an exception"
    },
    {
     "en": "Write try with one or more except clauses"
    },
    {
     "en": "Use the else clause"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "An ATM does not shut down when you type a wrong amount; it shows a message and asks again. That is exception handling.",
    "kn": "ತಪ್ಪು ಮೊತ್ತ ನಮೂದಿಸಿದಾಗ ATM ಸ್ಥಗಿತವಾಗುವುದಿಲ್ಲ; ಸಂದೇಶ ತೋರಿಸಿ ಮತ್ತೆ ಕೇಳುತ್ತದೆ. ಇದೇ ವಿನಾಯಿತಿ ನಿರ್ವಹಣೆ."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "How Python handles an exception"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "When an error occurs, the interpreter creates an exception object holding the error type, file name and position. Handing it to the runtime system is called throwing the exception. The runtime system then searches the call stack, from the current function back to the main program, for a matching handler; executing it is catching the exception. If none is found, the program stops."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Throwing: create the exception object and hand it over"
    },
    {
     "en": "Catching: a matching handler executes"
    },
    {
     "en": "Search goes back through the call stack"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "When an error occurs, the interpreter creates an exception object holding the error type, file name and position. Handing it to the runtime system is called throwing the exception. The runtime system then searches the call stack, from the current function back to the main program, for a matching handler; executing it is catching the exception. If none is found, the program stops.",
    "kn": "ದೋಷ ಉಂಟಾದಾಗ ಇಂಟರ್ಪ್ರಿಟರ್ ಒಂದು ವಿನಾಯಿತಿ ಆಬ್ಜೆಕ್ಟ್ ರಚಿಸುತ್ತದೆ; ಇದು ಥ್ರೋ ಮಾಡುವುದು. ಕಾಲ್ ಸ್ಟ್ಯಾಕ್‌ನಲ್ಲಿ ಸೂಕ್ತ ಹ್ಯಾಂಡ್ಲರ್ ಹುಡುಕಿ ಅದನ್ನು ಓಡಿಸುವುದು ಕ್ಯಾಚ್ ಮಾಡುವುದು. ಹ್ಯಾಂಡ್ಲರ್ ಸಿಗದಿದ್ದರೆ ಪ್ರೋಗ್ರಾಂ ನಿಲ್ಲುತ್ತದೆ."
   }
  },
